# Fillet edges (an extension): New Group > Fillet Edges with two top
# edges of the extrusion of path_extrude that meet at a corner rounds
# them at 1 mm, mitred where they meet. The screen lists the edges and
# takes a new radius, here an expression; Check Solid finds it sound
# each time.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 382.5 232.5
down L 382.5 232.5
up L 382.5 232.5
move 247.5 202.5
down L 247.5 202.5
up L 247.5 202.5
menu Features|Fillet Edges
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 150 125
twdown L 150 125
twup L 150 125
edit 1+1
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
